snippet.description:
This was fun.  When I started activating Parks on the Air, I built a 71' EFRW antenna inspired by Walt, K4OGO.  I used that wire antenna all the time and had great success with it.  Today, I revisit my old EFRW, but configure it in a whole new setup.  One antenna, one tuner, 5 bands.

